window.products.push({"id":1066069,"name":"Herbertz Germany Extremely Sharp Pocket Folding Kitchen Chef Knife Paring Utility Knife Natural Rosewood 440 Stainless Steel Japanese Style","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C9U9sLfjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SHARPNESS The sharpness achieved is only possible with a strong blade forged through a tempering process. Experience the sense of effortless cutting that is unlike any knife you have used before. THE WOOD WE USE The Tagayasan is a broad-leaf tree from the legumes family and is grown natively in Southeast Asia countries. In Japan, Tagayasan is also called Tettouboku, literally meaning iron sword wood, and, like the blackwood or purple wood, it is considered representative of high quality wood. The wood is hard, durable and resistant to corrosion. One of the characteristics of Tagayasan is that it takes a long time to grow – up to 100 years – until it can be used for wood. The actual color or the wood grain may differ from the image due to the nature of product. PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 x Knife 1 x Original gift box","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C9U9sLfjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Herbertz","source_asin":"B07WLDFQJ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WLDFQJ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WLDFQJ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
