window.products.push({"id":1066163,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner, 4 in 1 Personal Air Cooler, USB Personal Desktop Cooling Fan with Free Speeds, Adjustable Wind Direction, Mini Air Desktop C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eH2NvPRHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🌬【4 in 1 FUNCTIONS DESIGN】Portable air Cooler adopts the latest water evaporation technology and has low operating energy consumption. It can be used as a small air cooler, desk fan, humidifier, and personal cooling zone. You could always add ice cubes to the water tray for an extra cooling effect. 🌬【EASY TO OPERATE & CONTROL WIND SPEED】We will provide two ice trays, freeze the ice tray in advance, soak the filter, and put it in the water tank of the cooler to bring in a cool breeze immediately. Adopting a 180-degree step-less speed control knob design, a 90-degree air outlet that can blow up and down, so you can freely choose the wind speed according to your needs. 🌬【ENERGY SAVING & CLEANING】Compared with costly central AC, our 4.5W low-power portable air cooler is cheaper and energy-saving. It does not need to use other chemicals to cool the air; you can also live a low-carbon life. At the same time, it is easy to clean. Just pour water and clean the water tank with a soft brush or sponge. Replace the wet curtain regularly. This will be a good choice. 🌬【NIGHT LIGHT & RECHARGEABLE DESIGN】Mini air cooler comes with blue LED light. When you fall asleep at night, smart lighting will not affect your sleep quality. The portable charging device is powered by USB(no battery), compatible with PC/laptop, mobile power, AC adapter, suitable for home, office, outdoor picnic, camping, etc. 🌬【PACKAGE CONTENT & SERVICE】Air cooler, A USB cable, A User Manual, A wet filter, two iceboxes, and If you encounter any problems while using our products, please contact us. Notice that this personal air cooler is designed for creating private space cooling. It can't cool down a room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eH2NvPRHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B14CV56Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B14CV56Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B14CV56Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
