window.products.push({"id":1066324,"name":"Olive Wood Mezuzah with Scroll by YourHolyLandStore","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.43,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41b5qBzJgvL._AC_.jpg","description":"Made from olive wood with hand enamelled metal plate. The olive wood used for the product is of excellent quality. The wood is dried in a special natural processes. On the mezuzah there is Hebrew letter \"SHIN\". This is first letter of \"Shomer Dlatot Israel\" or \"Guardian of the Doors of Israel\" - one of the names of G-d. Included non kosher printed mezuzah scroll Length: 15.5cm/6inch Made in the Holy land (Israel). Come with certificate of origin. Supplied in high quality packaging Condition: new","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41b5qBzJgvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YourHolyLandStore","source_asin":"B003GAUF56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003GAUF56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003GAUF56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1066325,"name":"GOSEEK Rug Gripper, Upgraded Washable Removable Non-Slip Rug Grippers, for Area Rugs Underlay, Floor Mats, Hardwood Floors, Tile Floors, 10pcs, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JabArSMKS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【 Lasting Adhesive】：The product uses extra adhesive material to have a perfect grip on the rugs and the floor surface. upgraded design rug gripper fits carpet corners more efficiently. A larger contact surface can provide more effective adhesion and excellent rug slip grip. The more rug gripper used, the better the rug will be anchored to the floor. so that there is no fear of falling. No more tripping. It is exceptionally safe for the kids when they play! 【 Special design prevents curling and sliding】：Designed with advanced Anti Slip and Anti Curl technology keep the rugs in place, voiding slipping accidents and properly solve annoying carpet problems like curling, sliding, folding， and pet commoving. The edges won't slide or move and will stay firm in place. 【Washable-remove and clean】: The high-quality double-sided tape will not damage your floor and carpet during use. The carpet gripper is removable and reusable. You can quickly remove and rinse with water to remove dust. After cleaning and drying, they have the same stickiness, just like new. You can even put the rug in the washing machine without removing the holder, and the carpet gripper will not fall off. 【Easy Installation】: Installation is so easy. Remove the adhesive backing and stick the discs to the bottom of the rug you want to secure. Then remove the film covering the silicone surface and press the rug firmly onto the floor. Of course，make sure to remove any dust particles on the surface before using the grippers. 【Application scenario】: The carpet gripper is very versatile and can be used on any service, whether it is hardwood, marble tiles, stairs or smooth floors. Don't worry, the carpet gripper will work to keep the corners flat on the surface for a long time. But it is particularly reminded that it should be applied on a clean surface to get the best results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JabArSMKS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOSEEK","source_asin":"B09533X7BN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09533X7BN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09533X7BN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
