window.products.push({"id":1066358,"name":"Personalized Name Whippet Standing Fawn Christmas Tree Ornaments Circle Ceramic, Custom Text Gifts for Dog Mom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fmGoPI0bL._AC_SL1348_.jpg","description":"🎄 Show off your love for dogs with our Circle Ceramic Ornament. This Christmas tree ornament features a cute dog to symbolize the loving bond you share with your beloved pet. A unique keepsake that will make this Christmas truly memorable. This ceramic ornament comes with a sturdy ribbon for hanging, so you can proudly display them on a shelf, or hang them on your Christmas tree. This custom-made Christmas ornament is an affordable gift choice for any occasion, whether it's for a birthday or housewarming party, or as a great holiday gift for the dog lover in your life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fmGoPI0bL._AC_SL1348_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HoaLuong","source_asin":"B0B2SGMKGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2SGMKGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2SGMKGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1066359,"name":"Vindeco Premium Wine Air Pressure Pump Bottle Opener – Easy to use Wine Air Pressure Pump Buttle Opener – Great gift for Wine Lovers - FREE BONUS FOIL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oPUT1VetL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vindeco Wine Bottle Opener Set Easily open and enjoy every bottle of wine without the hassle of pulling, twisting and strong-arming traditional wine corkscrews. The Vindeco wine bottle opener features a sharp, durable needle and an integrated air pressure pump to cleanly extract natural and synthetic corks. A great gift idea for wine lovers, the wine bottle opener set also includes a wine foil cutter. Cleanly Uncork Every Bottle Designed to fit every wine bottle size, the wine air pressure pump opener features a semi-flexible collar and durable, sharp needle for removing corks without chipping or breaking, eliminating the risk of contaminating the wine. Simple to Use The Vindeco cork remover is easy to use. First, insert the needle down through the center of the cork. With one hand stabilizing the wine bottle, raise and lower the air pump handle until approximately half of the cork is removed. Grasp the wine bottle opener cover and gently pull up to fully remove the cork from the bottle opening. To remove the cork from the wine bottle opener, slide the clear outer ring downward. Includes Wine Foil Cutter The wine bottle opener set also includes a wine foil cutter to easily remove the foil cap for a neat, clean appearance. Ergonomically designed for easy use, place the wine foil cutter around the foil cap gently squeezing and twisting to cleanly cut through the foil wrapping. Perfect Wine Accessory Easy to use and clean, the Vindeco wine bottle opener is the perfect addition for the modern kitchen and home bar. The wine air pressure pump cork remover is great for quickly and easily opening bottles of wine at special events, picnics, parties with family and friends. Perfect for gift-giving, the wine accessory set is great for wine lovers, weddings, birthdays and special events. What’s Included: Wine Bottle Opener Wine Bottle Opener Wine foil cutter. Wine foil cutter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oPUT1VetL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vindeco","source_asin":"B083W3L3JY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083W3L3JY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083W3L3JY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
