window.products.push({"id":1066361,"name":"Venture Horizon Media Storage Tower Cabinet Single - 76” High Rack - Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SvAtdT2SL._AC_.jpg","description":"Nobody does it better! You may have seen other Media Storage Towers in your journeys but you have never come across the styling, variety, storage capacity or value for the money, anywhere. We beat the competition...hands down. We offer six (6) sizes in 5 colors. The sizes are Medium Single, Tall Single, Medium Double, Tall Double, Medium Triple and Tall Triple. We also did not skimp on the sizing like many other manufacturers. Our Media Storage Towers will indeed hold an entire media collection and then some. Our units hold over 40% more media (CD's, DVD's and VHS Tapes) than our leading competitors. Not only that but our units are also up to 70% less expensive. All that in a wall hugging slim cabinet design. Shelves are only 6\" deep but a generous 24\" wide. The 76\" high Single Tower has 12 adjustable shelves plus the fixed base. You can also choose to assemble any tower with or without the decorative Top Molding depending upon the look you want. Our Media Storage Towers are constructed from heavy duty laminated wood composites. They are framed in molded *MDF (medium density fiberboard) that enables us to trim the weight of our towers by about 30% over original models. They are available in both 50\" and 76\" heights in all 3 models (Single/Double/Triple). Choose from cherry, oak, walnut, black and white with a matching base. Assembly required. Made in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SvAtdT2SL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Venture Horizon","source_asin":"B000RK32BC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000RK32BC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000RK32BC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
