window.products.push({"id":1066364,"name":"A&O Zebra Roller Blinds Dual Layer Shades Easy to Install Day and Night Window Blinds 80\" Width Adjustable Length (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":142.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WPz1PNroL._AC_.jpg","description":"DOUBLE LAYER: Double layer zebra blind combines sheer and opaque fabric. You can control the light entering the room as you wish and provide the privacy. You can adjust the degree of overlap of transparent and opaque fabric. It is up to you to take full advantage of daylight or create an environment with dim light. (Note that these are not black out curtains.) MATERIAL: Polyester blend, a good choice to keep your curtains durable for a long time. You can dust it with a brush, wash it with cold water and use your blind for many years. Using blinds should not interfere with good ventilation in a clean environment. You can use it in the bathroom, bedroom, office or even in the kitchen as it is easy to clean. MEASUREMENT: We offer 72” height for every size and you can adjust it for your window. For installation, the depth must be 2.5”. For Inside Mounting: Measure the exact width of your window and order accordingly. Half inch space is needed for the header to be applied. If you order 42” you will get a 41.5” blinds. For Outside Mounting: You should add 4-6” to the window width when ordering to make sure it covers the whole window SAFETY AND GUARANTEE: Our tested cords make it easy to raise and lower the blinds. Please remember fix the chains of the blinds to the wall and keep your children and pets safe. Note that, we guarantee 100% satisfaction with our products. For any questions you have feel free to contact us. YOU WILL RECEIVE: Installation hardware including 2 screws, 2 rawl plugs, 2 brackets, and 2 clamps. An installation guide for an easy installation. You will need a drill to install your zebra blind. You can also watch our video for clarification.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WPz1PNroL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A&O","source_asin":"B097PYMH8Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097PYMH8Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097PYMH8Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
