window.products.push({"id":1066550,"name":"Winlyn 100 Pcs Table Name Number Tented Place Cards with Fall Maple Leaves Blank Seating Assignment Cards Escort Cards Greeting Cards Bulk 3.5\" x 2\" f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tFwrbxGDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quantity: 100 Pcs White Blank Place Cards with Fall Maple Leaves Spray Detailing. Size: The measurement of blank table name card appr. 4*3.5\"(L*W) when unfolded.Front side appr. 2\" high by 3.5\" wide when folded, the back is blank, which gives you plenty of room to write your guests name or other personalization. Material: Thick cardstock.These place cards don't need support to stand up on their own. Simply fold them along the score mark and they will stand tall during your table. The place cards could be used for different occasion. Used for place cards, table name place cards, blank place cards, table food name tags, table seating card, name place cards, blank greeting cards, White tabletop tent cards for catering, seat assignment paper cards for kids, farmers market signs,etc. Place card set features the fall maple leaves design in red and burnt orange. Perfect for an autumn theme wedding.With its expression of simple elegance it is a perfect compliment to any fall theme event. Make sure all your friends and family know where to sit around the dinner table with the help of these Fall Leaves Place Cards. Featuring a charming design of colorful fall leaves and plenty of room to write down your guests' names, these paper place cards will make a handy addition to your Thanksgiving dinner party, autumn wedding or other fall party. Just fold them horizontally, and then jot down the names of all your special guests on top. Then, set them at each place setting around the fall-themed dinner table to make it easy for everyone to find their seat when it's time to eat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tFwrbxGDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B07G5525F3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G5525F3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G5525F3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
