window.products.push({"id":1066701,"name":"foedo Heat Powered Stove Fan for Fireplace, 4 Blade Cocoon Fan for Wood Stove Fireplace， Efficiently Circulate Warm Air， 2pc Wood Stove Fan Heat Power","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OnfFRS9gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Parameters1.Material: anodized aluminum  2.Number of blades: 4 blades 3.Dimensions: 186mm / 7.32 \"wide, 95mm / 3.74\" deep, 189mm / 7.44 \"high 4.Weight: 600g 5.Operating temperature: 50 ° C (122 ° f) - 350 ° C (662 ° f) 6.Optimum temperature: 250 ° C (482 ° f) 7.Air flow: 450ft/m(Max.) 8.Running speed: 1470 RPM(Max.)Product Features 1.Suitable for all wood fireplaces and stoves. 2.Thermal power supply, environmental protection and energy saving, without any cost. 3.It is easy to install and placed on the plane far away from the flue. 4.Built in protection system to prevent fan overheating, innovative and durable design. 5.Silent operation. The only moving part of the fan is the blade assembly. You won't even feel the existence of the fan, but you will feel more warmth. 6.The fan base and blades are made of anodized aluminum and will not rust or corrode.MaintenanceThe stove fans do not require particular maintenance in normal operation, wipe it with a clean damp cloth if needed. Do not immerse in water or any cleaning olution. Safety store the fan in the original packaging during the off.seasons.Matters Needing Attention 1.The optimum working temperature is 80-250℃(176-482℉), not more than 350℃(662℉). 2.It is suggested that the temperature should be monitored by the electric furnace fan thermometer to avoid overheating and damaging the components. 3.If the fan base is still hot, never place the fan on an unprotected surface. 4.Don't place it in front of the chimney. Keep a distance of at least 4 \". 5.Do not place on the heat sink / grille. 6.Please don't touch it when using. Rotate the blade carefully. 7.When using the fan, please keep a certain distance from all obstacles. 8.Make sure that children and pets are looked after around your stove.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OnfFRS9gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foedo","source_asin":"B09S8RW168","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S8RW168","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S8RW168","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
