window.products.push({"id":1066754,"name":"K BASIX Set of 3 Fine Mesh Strainer for Kitchen - Stainless Steel Strainers for Pasta, Flour Strainer, Vegetable Strainer, Food Strainer Tea Sift, Sie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZOVm-5B+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Universal Food Strainer: All-Clads precision-machined sieve fine mesh stainless steel set has you covered for all your straining needs. We included our most commonly used size strainers in this three-piece set – a 3.1\" (80mm) fine mesh sieve, a 5.5\" (140mm) medium-coarse strainer, and a 7.9\" (200mm) coarse strainer. Durability: Our strainers for kitchen are made from durable, high-quality, food-grade metal strainer Stainless Steel that won't rust or bend While other handheld fine strainer break easily after a few uses, begin to rust, are difficult to clean, or do not sieve finely. Coated with a layer, this strainer maintains a clean look that's easy to clean. Kitchen Strainer: Our professional-grade rice strainer has an exclusive sealed steel rim that prevents food from getting trapped between the mesh and the rim. Cleaning is faster, easier, and more effective so your family is spending less time cleaning the strainers fine mesh and more time cooking with it. Convenient Design: K BASIX coladores de cocina has a lip that fits securely over the edge of a bowl. The small strainer mesh filters easily, which makes straining a breeze. The long handles are riveted to the bowl so they are strong, and they stay away from the heat if you are looking to pour simmering water over vegetables or noodles. Customer Satisfaction: Here at K BASIX we believe in creating durable, long-lasting products and have the confidence that our products will last, if there are ever any issues, just contact us and we will make it right. Order now and be assured that this product will live up to your expectations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZOVm-5B+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"K BASIX","source_asin":"B09S6R6L13","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S6R6L13","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S6R6L13","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
