window.products.push({"id":1066799,"name":"Fancy Panz Classic, Dress Up & Protect Your Foil Pan, Made in USA, Fits Half Size Foil Pans. Half size Foil Pan & Serving Spoon Included. Hot or Cold ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EyF2SvBbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Proudly Designed by two sisters and 100% made in the USA , Fancy Panz is an innovative solution to a common problem. Fancy Panz are the perfect solution for dressing up, transporting & serving from foil pans. We all love the convenience of foil pans, but when it comes to serving or transporting food in them, they can often be too flimsy & not so pretty! By retaining all of the conveniences of a foil pan and providing the look of your favorite serving dish, Fancy Panz is the all in one solution! Dress up that foil pan by lifting the attached frame and placing it inside your Fancy Panz, close the frame, snap on the clear lid, and you are ready to transport your casseroles, desserts, salads, anything- hot or cold! There are two different ways to serve from your Fancy Panz, remove the clear top and place it under your Fancy Panz where it acts as a trivet OR for times when critters may be present or weather is a factor, keep the clear top on and lift from the tab. That way, your food remains completely covered between servings and food temperature is maintained for longer. When your ready to leave the event, remove the foil pan and take your Fancy Panz back with you. Clean up in a breeze, wipe down your Fancy Panz with a damp cloth. Fancy Panz are also top rack dishwasher safe! Fancy Panz Classic accommodate a common “half size” foil pan measuring approximately 11-3/4 x 9-3/8 x 2-5/16. With its ribbed bottom, Fancy Panz helps maintain food temperature, too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EyF2SvBbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fancy Panz","source_asin":"B0C2ZS6JW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2ZS6JW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2ZS6JW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1066800,"name":"Photo Display Lights, 40 LED Photo String Lights with Clips for Picture Hanging Display, Indoor Fairy String Lights Pictures Cards Holder Lights for B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W1rFARnXL._AC_.jpg","description":"★ Photo Display String Lights and home decoration. It’s an absolutely Fun And Unique Way To Organize And Display Pictures, Photos, Artwork, Prints ❤No Need Buy A Bunch Of Costly Heavy Photo Frames ❤No Need Drill Hole or Use Glue To Attach Photos On The Wall ❤No Need Troublesome To Change Out Photo Frame By Frame,You Can Change Photos Whenever You Want. Imaging all the photos of your family and friends put together in a warm bling light, with the clip string lights, it can do much contribution in creating a romantic atmosphere in any celebrated day. Just show your warm heart to your family and friends and give them a big surprise! It makes your plain white wall come to life with pictures of all the things that matter to the one and the thing you care. Makes you distracting from the unhappy or even make us think about all the great things in our lives that we can still appreciate after a loss. ➢ Specifications: -LED Color:Warm White  -LED/Clip Count:40  -Clip size:5.3*1.3cm -Total Length:5 meters -Spacing between each two bulbs:10cm  -Material:PVC and transparent clips and wire -Lighting Effect Modes: 8 ➢ Package Including: -1* 40 Photo Clip String Lights (warm white)  -1* Remote Control ➢ Features: -Easy to use: just plug in the usb cable for power on and power off by unpluging. -Safe to use: made of high quaility PVC and cooper wire, no heat energy consumption. -Firm and durable clips: hold your photos tightly, won't slip with a long time use. ★ Best Customer Service: If have any problems with our products or service Please kindly feel free to contact us we will response and handle as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W1rFARnXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HYS","source_asin":"B0753GWZRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0753GWZRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0753GWZRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
