window.products.push({"id":1066848,"name":"Let's Make Memories Personalized Text Pumpkin - Custom Light Up Pumpkin with Any Message - Resin - Indoor/Outdoor - Halloween Décor/Harvest Décor - Ad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mjIfLmd3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LIGHT UP FALL CELEBRATIONS: This elegant, personalized pumpkin will light up all your indoor/outdoor fall celebrations. Add a soft glow to your front porch, brighten a walkway, adorn a mantel or make it your Thanksgiving centerpiece. PERFECTLY PERSONALIZED: Choose cream (pictured), orange, silver glitter or gold glitter. Customize your pumpkin with any 3-line scripted text message up to 10 characters on lines 1 and 3 and up to 12 characters on line 2. CONVENIENT TIMER. Extend battery life with a 3-way switch and 6-hour timer. Turn your pumpkin on at dusk, then sleep soundly knowing it will automatically turn off in 6 hours. Uses 3 AAA batteries (not included). PREMIUM QUALITY: Made of durable, weather-resistant resin with built-in yellow LED lights and waterproof battery compartment: Large (9\"Hx7.5\" dia.) (pictured), Small (7\"Hx5.5\" dia.), XL (12.5\"Hx10.5\" dia.). Imported for final manufacture locally. A GIFT TO FALL FOR: A Halloween and Thanksgiving treat! Designed for indoor/outdoor use, friends and family will love displaying their pumpkin throughout autumn. Or add a touch of the season to an office, fall festival or dining room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mjIfLmd3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Let's Make Memories","source_asin":"B09BMHB27Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BMHB27Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BMHB27Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1066849,"name":"ZOEYEA Neck Fan, Portable Bladeless Hands Free Fan, Adjustable Angle 360° Cooling USB Rechargeable Quiet Wearable Hanging Sport Personal Fan, 3 Speeds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hfOeTRtAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍【HANDS FREE DESIGN & NEVER TWIST HAIR】Our 2021 New Neck Fan can be used by simply placing it on your neck, no need to clog your hands. Bladeless design, when using the fan, you don't have to worry about your hair getting caught on the fan blades, it can be used safely by everybody. 👍【360° SURROUND STRONG WIND & 3 SPEED ADJUSTABLE】 Our portable hand free fan adopts a unique air outlet shape design, 360-degree surround type, with 30 large air outlets around the neck, the wind is increased by 90%, it can be used for the entire face and neck around, which products enough air to keep you cool always. 3 Speed: Low/medium/high speed level. Adjust appropriate fan speed by pressing the power button. 👍【 ADJUSTABLE ANGEL & BEST COMFORT】The middle part of bladeless neck fan is made of food-grade silicone material, the angle can be adjusted at will, flexible and not easy to break, to provide the best angle of comfort. Food-grade silicone material will not irritate the skin, soft and comfortable, It will not be uncomfortable to wear for a long time. 👍【LONG-LASTING BATTERY& SILENT DESIGN】Our usb neck fan adopts the latest low-power design, it only takes a short time to charge, it can keep working for a whole day (depend on different speeds). The wearable neckband fan’s motor has been modified, low noise, it is quiet enough to hear your own breath. 👍【FASHION STYLE & USE ANYWHERE】Personal neck fans use unique headphone fan design, the stylish style makes you look fashion and cool. The portable fan is very suitable for personal cooling, offices, churches, outdoor activities, such as camping, traveling, hiking, climbing and watching sports games, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hfOeTRtAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZOEYEA","source_asin":"B08YRFTMSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YRFTMSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YRFTMSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
